# Phase Acceptance Report Template
# ===========================================
#
# Purpose:  Phase closeout验收报告模板
# Usage:    cp templates/acceptance_report.md.template project/<phase>_<ip>/docs/phase<N>_acceptance_report.md
#           Fill in actual values from reports/ + L3.3 sign-off
# Reference: docs/process/phase_closeout.md
#
# Important:  This is the PROJECT-LEVEL acceptance report (per IP / per phase).
#             The global docs/ only contains TEMPLATES and OVERALL STATUS
#             (see docs/CHANGELOG.md for cross-phase changes).
#
# Sections (7 required):
# 1. Executive Summary
# 2. Verification Matrix (7 quality gates)
# 3. Resource Utilization (IP + wrapper)
# 4. Timing (WNS/TNS/WHS)
# 5. CDC Analysis
# 6. L3.3 Sign-off
# 7. Deliverables
# 8. Known Limitations
# 9. Next Phase Plan
# 10. Lessons Learned (link)
# 11. Signatures

